00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.449
Hey did you know that

00:00:18.449 --> 00:00:24.060
around 72 percent of all men
and 74% of all women are not satisfied

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:28.439
with the way that they look and in a lot
of cases this leads to low self-esteem

00:00:28.439 --> 00:00:34.440
and that influences your whole life. Now
have you ever actually asked yourself

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:40.079
why do you feel this way? It is because
