00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:19.280
Change your own
definition of beauty because you won't

00:02:19.290 --> 00:02:24.959
be able to change the media's ideals of
beauty. So don't focus on the fake beauty.

00:02:24.959 --> 00:02:31.260
Focus on real life beauty. Beauty that
you see in everyday life. The beauty of

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:34.769
unique people where nobody is the same
